    {
      "index": 0,
      "tag": "h1",
      "attrs": {
        "id": "shattered-worlds-for-slayer-xp"
      },
      "text": "Shattered Worlds for Slayer XP",
      "location": {
        "start": 164109,
        "end": 164184
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 164184,
        "end": 164185
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "",
      "location": {
        "start": 164185,
        "end": 164256
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 164256,
        "end": 164257
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "tag": "h3",
      "attrs": {
        "id": "introduction"
      },
      "text": "Introduction",
      "location": {
        "start": 164257,
        "end": 164296
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 164296,
        "end": 164297
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "Shattered Worlds is a combat-based minigame where it's reward currency, Shattered Anima, is awarded for killing mobs and achieving objectives in the minigame. This currency can be used to purchase a variety of abilities, titles, pets, slayer masks and notably, Huge Slayer XP Lamps. At level 120 this gives 103,132 Slayer experience, at the cost of 6 million Anima. This guide will go over the most efficient method of farming Anima to purchase these lamps, to achieve high Slayer XP rates.",
      "location": {
        "start": 164297,
        "end": 164794
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 164794,
        "end": 164795
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "​",
      "location": {
        "start": 164795,
        "end": 164810
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 164810,
        "end": 164811
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "Note: This method also gives high  XP, but is not recommended as the main way to train slayer once the player is at a higher level, due to offering nothing but slayer XP.",
      "location": {
        "start": 164811,
        "end": 165113
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 165113,
        "end": 165114
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "​",
      "location": {
        "start": 165114,
        "end": 165129
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 165129,
        "end": 165130
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "tag": "h3",
      "attrs": {
        "id": "stats"
      },
      "text": "Stats",
      "location": {
        "start": 165130,
        "end": 165155
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 165155,
        "end": 165156
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "⬥ World Set: 101-105",
      "location": {
        "start": 165156,
        "end": 165183
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 165183,
        "end": 165184
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "⬥ Optimal Anima Rate: 170m/h",
      "location": {
        "start": 165184,
        "end": 165219
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 165219,
        "end": 165220
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "⬥ Optimal  XP Rate: ~1.9m/h",
      "location": {
        "start": 165220,
        "end": 165370
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 165370,
        "end": 165371
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "​",
      "location": {
        "start": 165371,
        "end": 165386
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 165386,
        "end": 165387
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "tag": "h3",
      "attrs": {
        "id": "location-and-how-to-get-there"
      },
      "text": "Location and How to Get There",
      "location": {
        "start": 165387,
        "end": 165460
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 165460,
        "end": 165461
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "The Shattered Worlds minigame is located in the south of the Lumbridge Swamp, easily accessible via the Lumbridge lodestone and running south west. Direct teleports can be bought from the reward shop, but are not recommended to be used.",
      "location": {
        "start": 165461,
        "end": 165704
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 165704,
        "end": 165705
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "​",
      "location": {
        "start": 165705,
        "end": 165720
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 165720,
        "end": 165721
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "tag": "h3",
      "attrs": {
        "id": "useful-items"
      },
      "text": "Useful Items",
      "location": {
        "start": 165721,
        "end": 165760
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 165760,
        "end": 165761
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "⬥ Acceleration Powerburst  - Reduces the cooldown of mobility abilities such as Bladed Dive , Surge  and Escape  to 0.6s, allowing for extremely quick travel over large distances.",
      "location": {
        "start": 165761,
        "end": 166454
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 166454,
        "end": 166455
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "​",
      "location": {
        "start": 166455,
        "end": 166470
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 166470,
        "end": 166471
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "⬥ Essence of Finality Amulet with Dark Bow spec   - Required for optimal rates, allows for huge AoE damage to be dealt in conjunction with Mechanised Chinchompas .",
      "location": {
        "start": 166471,
        "end": 167015
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 167015,
        "end": 167016
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "​",
      "location": {
        "start": 167016,
        "end": 167031
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 167031,
        "end": 167032
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "tag": "h3",
      "attrs": {
        "id": "method"
      },
      "text": "Method",
      "location": {
        "start": 167032,
        "end": 167059
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 167059,
        "end": 167060
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "⬥ The best worlds to farm are 101-105, due to them starting with the Feeling Pumped modifier, and having low HP mobs.",
      "location": {
        "start": 167060,
        "end": 167184
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 167184,
        "end": 167185
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Feeling Pumped gives the player unlimited adrenaline for 10s upon activation, which allows the player to deal massive damage in a short time, and is required for this style of farming.",
      "location": {
        "start": 167185,
        "end": 167385
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 167385,
        "end": 167386
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "​",
      "location": {
        "start": 167386,
        "end": 167401
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 167401,
        "end": 167402
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "⬥ Shattered worlds has 3 main objectives, kill X amount of enemies, deal X amount of damage, or repair the portal. Completing an objective quickly rewards the player with skipping worlds in that bracket, up to 3 worlds skipped if the first world is completed in under 1 minute.",
      "location": {
        "start": 167402,
        "end": 167686
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 167686,
        "end": 167687
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• To farm anima efficiently, skipping worlds is the priority. However, due to RNG in the objectives, skipping 2 worlds is often more achievable.",
      "location": {
        "start": 167687,
        "end": 167845
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 167845,
        "end": 167846
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "​",
      "location": {
        "start": 167846,
        "end": 167861
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 167861,
        "end": 167862
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "⬥ Ranged  offers the most efficient way to farm these worlds, via the usage of the Dark bow special attack  , stored in an Essence of Finality necklace  to allow it to be used with Mechanical chinchompas , allowing the player to often one-hit large groups of enemies. If Feeling Pumped has not activated yet, simply use basic abilities or thresholds like Snapshot . An example video is shown below featuring various world skips.",
      "location": {
        "start": 167862,
        "end": 168984
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
