      }
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "Note: Melee can also be viable, having strong AoE potential with abilities such as (, , , , ), however will be significantly slower than ranged.",
      "location": {
        "start": 169001,
        "end": 169739
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 169739,
        "end": 169740
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "​",
      "location": {
        "start": 169740,
        "end": 169755
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 169755,
        "end": 169756
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "⬥ As speed is the most important factor here, Acceleration potions  can be particularly helpful for clearing large distances, to get to more enemies or to rush to the portal after finishing an objective. If getting to the portal quicker will help with world skips, use it, otherwise save it for the next world where it may come in more useful, this is up to the player's discretion.",
      "location": {
        "start": 169756,
        "end": 170297
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 170297,
        "end": 170298
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "​",
      "location": {
        "start": 170298,
        "end": 170313
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 170313,
        "end": 170314
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "⬥ The usage of Target Cycling is heavily recommended. This is due to auto-attacks stalling repeated Essence of Finality special attacks , preventing you from continuously speccing whilst Feeling Pumped is active. Targets can still be clicked if the player is careful not to auto-attack.",
      "location": {
        "start": 170314,
        "end": 170726
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 170726,
        "end": 170727
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "​",
      "location": {
        "start": 170727,
        "end": 170742
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 170742,
        "end": 170743
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "⬥ Soulsplit  is used for all healing, as the massive damage dealt generates a lot of healing. Solid food is also recommended, as adrenaline is effectively infinite, alongside healing a large amount in one bite and therefore has no downside.",
      "location": {
        "start": 170743,
        "end": 171112
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 171112,
        "end": 171113
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "​",
      "location": {
        "start": 171113,
        "end": 171128
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
